      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783936341406,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "基本原理相同\n仅仅是变成了3*3的矩阵\n将复杂变换看作多个变换的符\n合有助于图形理解",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "grG9PTRYoHG9IsuCVlj_h",
      "originalText": "基本原理相同\n仅仅是变成了3*3的矩阵\n将复杂变换看作多个变换的符合有助于图形理解",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
